    "article_summary": "The article describes a nickel-catalyzed allylic defluorinative alkylation of trifluoromethyl alkenes using redox-active esters as radical precursors. This reductive cross-coupling method utilizes a Ni/Pybox catalyst system and Zn as a reductant to synthesize functionalized gem-difluoroalkenes under mild conditions, demonstrating high functional group tolerance and applicability to late-stage modification of natural products and drugs.",
